    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n53392" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρος</span></b> 
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">[ᾰ]</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>heavy sleep,
			torpor</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κ. καὶ κραιπάλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					873b14
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.203
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Phld.
				<u>D.</u>
				1.18
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Str.
				16.4.19
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Max.Tyr.
				16.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				8.231
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάρῳ προσφερὴς κατάληψις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Iamb.
					<u>Myst.</u>
					3.2
				</span></i>
			: pl., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μελαγχολίαι καὶ κάροι καὶ λήθαργοι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Stoic.</u>
					3.57
				</span></i>
			; <i>drowsiness</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Am.</u>
				39
			</span></i>.</div>
